{"title":"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Fast,_easy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Fast, easy)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the positive solution to\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/9/fa9c9ff03c23586114f36989a00fe3362d4a8574.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 1{x^2-10x-29}+\\frac1{x^2-10x-45}-\\frac 2{x^2-10x-69}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"416\" height=\"37\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We could clear out the denominators by multiplying, though that would be unnecessarily tedious.\n</p><p>To simplify the equation, substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/b/6abf59e813c39bc501449d27d00b387e3e03d7c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = x^2 - 10x - 29$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"142\" height=\"15\" /> (the denominator of the first fraction). We can rewrite the equation as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/3/833541f3b349bca5cda650128cf868c40f635bf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{a} + \\frac{1}{a - 16} - \\frac{2}{a - 40} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"199\" height=\"37\" />. Multiplying out the denominators now, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85d76b58a1a9f13d4accc30db88c342522655420.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a - 16)(a - 40) + a(a - 40) - 2(a)(a - 16) = 0\\]\" width=\"375\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67c44327e9b308dabfff9846b244424e68ce269f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-64a + 40 \\times 16 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"155\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d6cc5bbcaca2ea70d1998da025c3f0873bb8562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />. Re-substituting, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/b/05b850d0e490c006dd0153cc0dcc40324a539b00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 = x^2 - 10x - 29 \\Longleftrightarrow 0 = (x - 13)(x + 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"347\" height=\"19\" />. The positive <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Root\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Root\">root</a> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/9/609db1b6b50bb43ed69f604383115983faf5f879.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{013}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SpSuqWY01SE?t=935\">https://youtu.be/SpSuqWY01SE?t=935</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_vslL2YcEaE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_vslL2YcEaE</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28Fast.2C_easy.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(Fast,_easy)\">Video Solution(Fast, easy)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(Fast, easy)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rP8_-36n1ps\">https://youtu.be/rP8_-36n1ps</a> \n~MK\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME\" title=\"1990 AIME\">1990 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•<